color #1/H:148 forest green
color #1/H:152,/H:150,/H:144 gold
surface pocket1_lining
transparency pocket1_lining 70
color pocket1_lining slate gray
marker #101 position 23.260,23.304,17.595 color red radius 1.0
2dlabels text "Pocket 1 (76% druggable) *" xpos 0.02 ypos 0.95 color black size 14

